      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEND IT ALFIE (1) was strongly fancied last time but ran below expectations when fourth (22.24), beaten 5.5 lengths. Should be very hard to beat this time. RINGSIDE ATLAS (4) had the drop on the lead before drawing clear to score (21.92) at this track in Novice race over 381m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. EXILE DANCER (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (31.01) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Better than last start and can bounce back. SUNSET BERSERK (7) is in winning form and worth including in the main hopes.",
